{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X对人物心理因果和故事过渡的交代不如Y完整，尤其S06、S11至S13，Y保留了更多犹疑、决定形成的过程，以及即使未来无人亲近也要好好生活的最终落点。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的优势是视觉层级明确，加亮的关键词能迅速抓住每段主轴，小字感受按音乐进程出现，让观众不必一次读完所有信息，也能感受到音乐细节的变化。它的音乐描写明显更具体，情绪转折也有更细的层次；但Y的人物叙事更完整，为什么舍不得、为什么不回头、最后怎样重新安顿自己，交代得更充分。综合而言，我选X，因为它更好地兼顾了边听边扫、抓重点和音乐感受，而Y更胜在故事解释的完整性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bafe6547-5bd9-4638-9890-c8a4d73a9eb0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T090711263237Z", "elapsed_seconds": 124.984, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T09:09:16.268653+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cff91454eb41968dfa9d8221433f8b0fec6e36a36fa4508a331d5674d679c61b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f68